text = "Move: A / D
Jump: Space (double jump if bought)
Dash: double-tap A or D (if bought)
Attack: Left Mouse Button (mouse-aimed)
Weapons: 1-4, Excellent weapon: 5
Interact: E (buildings, chests, hostages)
Inventory / Equipment: Tab
Skill Tree: K
Shop: walk into the shop zone
Dungeon: walk into the red zone, press F
Pause: Esc"
